    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1168">

                <pb facs="1079" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111F23/13</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of the Counselor for the Department of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 25, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Explained orally to the German Ambassador the decision of this Government as to
                    the character of the <hi rendition="#italic">Farn</hi>, and the treatment she
                    would receive as a naval tender of Germany.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
